agents: A B 

knowledge: 
A knows A B pk(A) pk(B) inv(pk(A)) .
B knows A B pk(A) pk(B) inv(pk(B)) .

events: 

queries:

choreo:

A: new X. 
A -> B: crypt((tag1,A,B,exp(g,X)),pk(B)).

B: new Y. 
B -> A: crypt((tag2,A,B,exp(g,Y)),pk(A)).

A: new MSG1.
A -> B: scrypt((tag3,MSG1),exp(exp(g,X),Y)).

B: new MSG2.
B -> A: scrypt((tag6,MSG2),exp(exp(g,X),Y)).
MSG1 secret between A B.
MSG2 secret between A B